                                "sense_id": "cb1e165c-1ba3-3af4-a26d-b655d820d3b1",
                                "text": "We scrimmaged a few times and then settled into boring drills."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed08abdc-efa6-413c-a60b-609899317bdc",
                                "sense_id": "cb1e165c-1ba3-3af4-a26d-b655d820d3b1",
                                "text": "Elwood caught sight of a football field where some boys scrimmaged and yelped."
